    "preamble": "S.Moham vs The Food Safety Officer on 10 March, 2021 Author: N.Anand Venkatesh Bench: N.Anand Venkatesh 1 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 10.03.2021 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice N.Anand Venkatesh Crl.O.P No.20340 of 2020 and Crl.M.P Nos.8502 and 8503 of 2020 1. S.Moham, S/o.Subramani 2. M.Subramani, S/o.Kannappan ...Petitioners Vs. The Food Safety Officer, Sriperumbudur Block, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug, Administration Dept., No.42-A, Railway Road, Kanchipuram District. ...Respondent Prayer : Criminal Original Petition filed under Section 482 of Criminal Procedure Code, praying to call for the records pertaining to the charge sheet in C.C.No.27 of 2020 by the District Munsif cum Judicial Magistrate, Sriperum Kanchipuram District and quash the same. For Petitioner : Mr.M.P.Saravanan For Respondent : Mr.Mohammed Riyaz Additional Public Pros http://www.judis.nic.in 2 Order",
